{"book":"II Chronicles","chapter":2,"entries":[{"id":11212,"title":"II Chronicles 2:1","segments":["¶And Solomon determined to build an house for the name of the LORD, and an house for his kingdom."],"ref":"II Chronicles 2:1","verse":1,"words":[{"text":"¶And Solomon","strong":"H8010"},{"text":" determined","strong":"H559"},{"text":" to build","strong":"H1129"},{"text":" an house","strong":"H1004"},{"text":" for the name","strong":"H8034"},{"text":" of the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":", and an house","strong":"H1004"},{"text":" for his kingdom","strong":"H4438"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":11213,"title":"II Chronicles 2:2","segments":["And Solomon told out threescore and ten thousand men to bear burdens, and fourscore thousand to hew in the mountain, and three thousand and six hundred to oversee them."],"ref":"II Chronicles 2:2","verse":2,"words":[{"text":"And Solomon","strong":"H8010"},{"text":" told out","strong":"H5608"},{"text":" threescore and ten","strong":"H7657"},{"text":" thousand","strong":"H505"},{"text":" men","strong":"H376"},{"text":" to bear burdens","strong":"H5449"},{"text":", and fourscore","strong":"H8084"},{"text":" thousand","strong":"H505"},{"text":"","strong":"H376"},{"text":" to hew","strong":"H2672"},{"text":" in the mountain","strong":"H2022"},{"text":", and three","strong":"H7969"},{"text":" thousand","strong":"H505"},{"text":" and six","strong":"H8337"},{"text":" hundred","strong":"H3967"},{"text":" to oversee","strong":"H5329"},{"text":" them."}]},{"id":11214,"title":"II Chronicles 2:3","segments":["And Solomon sent to Huram the king of Tyre, saying, As thou didst deal with David my father, and didst send him cedars to build him an house to dwell therein, [even so deal with me]. {Huram: or, Hiram}"],"ref":"II Chronicles 2:3","verse":3,"words":[{"text":"And Solomon","strong":"H8010"},{"text":" sent","strong":"H7971"},{"text":" to Huram","strong":"H2361"},{"text":" the king","strong":"H4428"},{"text":" of Tyre","strong":"H6865"},{"text":", saying","strong":"H559"},{"text":", As thou didst deal","strong":"H6213"},{"text":" with David","strong":"H1732"},{"text":" my father","strong":"H1"},{"text":", and didst send","strong":"H7971"},{"text":" him cedars","strong":"H730"},{"text":" to build","strong":"H1129"},{"text":" him an house","strong":"H1004"},{"text":" to dwell","strong":"H3427"},{"text":" therein, [even so deal with me]. {Huram: or, Hiram}"}]},{"id":11215,"title":"II Chronicles 2:4","segments":["Behold, I build an house to the name of the LORD my God, to dedicate [it] to him, [and] to burn before him sweet incense, and for the continual shewbread, and for the burnt offerings morning and evening, on the sabbaths, and on the new moons, and on the solemn feasts of the LORD our God. This [is an ordinance] for ever to Israel. {sweet...: Heb. incense of spices}"],"ref":"II Chronicles 2:4","verse":4,"words":[{"text":"Behold, I build","strong":"H1129"},{"text":" an house","strong":"H1004"},{"text":" to the name","strong":"H8034"},{"text":" of the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":" my God","strong":"H430"},{"text":", to dedicate","strong":"H6942"},{"text":" [it] to him, [and] to burn","strong":"H6999"},{"text":" before","strong":"H6440"},{"text":" him sweet","strong":"H5561"},{"text":" incense","strong":"H7004"},{"text":", and for the continual","strong":"H8548"},{"text":" shewbread","strong":"H4635"},{"text":", and for the burnt offerings","strong":"H5930"},{"text":" morning","strong":"H1242"},{"text":" and evening","strong":"H6153"},{"text":", on the sabbaths","strong":"H7676"},{"text":", and on the new moons","strong":"H2320"},{"text":", and on the solemn feasts","strong":"H4150"},{"text":" of the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":" our God","strong":"H430"},{"text":". This [is an ordinance] for ever","strong":"H5769"},{"text":" to Israel","strong":"H3478"},{"text":". {sweet...: Heb. incense of spices}"}]},{"id":11216,"title":"II Chronicles 2:5","segments":["And the house which I build [is] great: for great [is] our God above all gods."],"ref":"II Chronicles 2:5","verse":5,"words":[{"text":"And the house","strong":"H1004"},{"text":" which I build","strong":"H1129"},{"text":" [is] great","strong":"H1419"},{"text":": for great","strong":"H1419"},{"text":" [is] our God","strong":"H430"},{"text":" above all gods","strong":"H430"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":11217,"title":"II Chronicles 2:6","segments":["But who is able to build him an house, seeing the heaven and heaven of heavens cannot contain him? who [am] I then, that I should build him an house, save only to burn sacrifice before him? {is able: Heb. hath retained, or, obtained strength}"],"ref":"II Chronicles 2:6","verse":6,"words":[{"text":"But who is able","strong":"H6113"},{"text":"","strong":"H3581"},{"text":" to build","strong":"H1129"},{"text":" him an house","strong":"H1004"},{"text":", seeing the heaven","strong":"H8064"},{"text":" and heaven","strong":"H8064"},{"text":" of heavens","strong":"H8064"},{"text":" cannot contain","strong":"H3557"},{"text":" him? who [am] I then, that I should build","strong":"H1129"},{"text":" him an house","strong":"H1004"},{"text":", save only","strong":"H518"},{"text":" to burn sacrifice","strong":"H6999"},{"text":" before","strong":"H6440"},{"text":" him? {is able: Heb. hath retained, or, obtained strength}"}]},{"id":11218,"title":"II Chronicles 2:7","segments":["Send me now therefore a man cunning to work in gold, and in silver, and in brass, and in iron, and in purple, and crimson, and blue, and that can skill to grave with the cunning men that [are] with me in Judah and in Jerusalem, whom David my father did provide. {to grave: Heb. to grave gravings}"],"ref":"II Chronicles 2:7","verse":7,"words":[{"text":"Send","strong":"H7971"},{"text":" me now therefore a man","strong":"H376"},{"text":" cunning","strong":"H2450"},{"text":" to work","strong":"H6213"},{"text":" in gold","strong":"H2091"},{"text":", and in silver","strong":"H3701"},{"text":", and in brass","strong":"H5178"},{"tex